{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Test 4","y":0.029069767165896376,"w":0.061728394826253238,"c":1,"x":0.11316872382144129},{"y":0.076402142450811894,"c":1,"x":0.15826817259203826,"t":"Many people are also simply not familiar with many instances of AI actually","w":0.71433629353841155,"h":0.022329388855483745},{"y":0.095698757097208542,"c":1,"w":0.72869832356770836,"t":"working, because it often happens in the background. Instead, they are acutely","x":0.15829099962636406,"h":0.022475994096627927},{"h":0.02162781929941715,"x":0.15625198740658192,"t":"aware of instances where Al goes wrong. Embarrassing Al failures receive a","y":0.11526598860370008,"w":0.7142524210611978,"c":1},{"w":0.72880203247070319,"t":"disproportionate amount of media attention, emphasising the message that we","x":0.15617859895821312,"c":1,"y":0.13220425917105194,"h":0.024388494143356865},{"c":1,"t":"cannot rely on technology. Machine learning is not foolproof, in part because the","y":0.15012598213422423,"x":0.15615306177182503,"w":0.75563537597656261,"h":0.027500595164664077},{"h":0.018373711791560887,"t":"humans who design it aren't.","y":0.17288612974262063,"w":0.2741265869140625,"c":1,"x":0.15612945172534864},{"t":"Feelings about Al run deep. In a recent experiment, people from a range of","y":0.20150193348095735,"w":0.70602320353190096,"x":0.15211527711875023,"h":0.022008035432885209,"c":1},{"h":0.018977524675384938,"x":0.15432099512337535,"c":1,"t":"backgrounds were given various sci-fi films about AI to watch and then asked","y":0.22084805631817317,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"w":0.79038213094075516,"x":0.15625990249757915,"y":0.23954254893913407,"h":0.021744077702714248,"c":1,"t":"questions about automation in everyday life. It was found that, regardless of whether"},{"t":"the film they watched depicted AI in a positive or negative light, simply watching","h":0.02476190762469288,"x":0.15412526932524087,"c":1,"w":0.75966074625651048,"y":0.25830795237826087},{"t":"a cinematic vision of our technological future polarised the participants' attitudes.","x":0.15432098063371816,"w":0.76748972574869789,"h":0.020400197823280619,"y":0.27906976725576915,"c":1},{"t":"Optimists became more extreme in their enthusiasm for AI and sceptics became","y":0.29740365565214733,"w":0.74517328898111979,"c":1,"h":0.021570771827293389,"x":0.15621163908587163},{"t":"even more guarded.","y":0.31831395329767076,"w":0.18930040995279948,"c":1,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.15432098874182829},{"h":0.023241185748815729,"t":"This suggests people use relevant evidence about Al in a biased manner to support","w":0.77197428385416678,"x":0.15413137293384457,"c":1,"y":0.35211829884829182},{"t":"their existing attitudes, a deep-rooted human tendency known asỗạconfirmation","y":0.37199514788561905,"c":1,"w":0.73883951822916683,"x":0.1521857283775602,"h":0.021776447588198411},{"t":"biasi","x":0.15432098844392431,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.39098837185858737,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239574},{"w":0.74305074055989584,"h":0.022923029213266055,"t":"'. As Al is represented more and more in media and entertainment, it could lead","c":1,"y":0.39063919299698746,"x":0.19741927564330297},{"t":"to a society split between those who benefit from Al and those who reject it. More","c":1,"y":0.41094085645358147,"x":0.15218403681268314,"h":0.019636374339900176,"w":0.76765686035156244},{"h":0.023921267865543827,"x":0.15210830707132772,"w":0.7925662740071614,"c":1,"t":"pertinently, refusing to accept the advantages offered by Al could place a large group","y":0.42869287974170933},{"h":0.019239542481475191,"c":1,"w":0.343922602335612,"t":"of people at a serious disadvantage.","x":0.15214291632317156,"y":0.44898826846053563},{"w":0.76577255249023446,"y":0.48538191951043952,"h":0.023672187005392309,"c":1,"t":"Fortunately, we already have some ideas about how to improve trust in AI. Simply","x":0.15207482857996638},{"w":0.74522664388020832,"y":0.5024413204765994,"t":"having previous experience with Al can significantly improve people's opinions","x":0.15002737577405942,"c":1,"h":0.024598583315792011},{"y":0.523826251329637,"w":0.74928904215494796,"t":"about the technology, as was found in the study mentioned above. Evidence also","x":0.15210072856709303,"h":0.022796920668531229,"c":1},{"w":0.74520563761393233,"x":0.15208987652921982,"h":0.023818010435789572,"t":"suggests the more you use other technologies such as the internet, the more you","y":0.54249206205761658,"c":1},{"y":0.56343867733112651,"c":1,"w":0.10554634094238283,"h":0.014557036409950874,"t":"trust them.","x":0.15200772448024766},{"x":0.15209907622177354,"w":0.74518213907877606,"h":0.021561641715581059,"t":"Another solution may be to reveal more about the algorithms which Al uses and","c":1,"y":0.59906626969678201},{"h":0.02240177599364368,"t":"the purposes they serve. Several high-profile social media companies and online","x":0.15003039574325017,"y":0.61805571697201467,"c":1,"w":0.75136550903320298},{"x":0.15001743640327875,"t":"marketplaces already release transparency reports about government requests and","h":0.024044856867885711,"y":0.63702840679887929,"w":0.76169153849283866,"c":1},{"h":0.024140208573448119,"x":0.15004580695666797,"c":1,"y":0.65451959009184979,"w":0.76166997273763037,"t":"surveillance disclosures. A similar practice for Al could help people have a better"},{"t":"understanding of the way algorithmic decisions are made.","w":0.54152552286783862,"h":0.021618433077287613,"c":1,"y":0.67516540005839898,"x":0.15003860086003168},{"y":0.7122093021145891,"t":"F","w":0.016460905075073237,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.10288065848539107,"c":1},{"t":"Research suggests that allowing people some control over Al decision-making could","w":0.78838399251302094,"c":1,"y":0.71209228125674184,"x":0.15003676675900085,"h":0.022317574077556745},{"w":0.74540532430013018,"t":"also improve trust and enable Al to learn from human experience. For example,","h":0.025421502031341969,"c":1,"x":0.14792895590474472,"y":0.72904728309056588},{"w":0.77802769978841146,"x":0.15007989022289089,"y":0.7509749152085804,"t":"one study showed that when people were allowed the freedom to slightly modify an","c":1,"h":0.02152356438698555},{"t":"algorithm, they felt more satisfied with its decisions, more likely to believe it was","c":1,"x":0.14807548003663545,"y":0.77022585883169792,"w":0.76146006266276056,"h":0.022544925990739317},{"x":0.14805427349064776,"y":0.78902924736422075,"h":0.019154781166319301,"t":"superior and more likely to use it in the future.","w":0.43849207560221354,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"We don't need to understand the intricate inner workings of AI systems, but if","x":0.14997513065934687,"y":0.8250224235520649,"h":0.024409863637108731,"w":0.72679809570312492},{"t":"people are given a degree of responsibility for how they are implemented, they will","h":0.022954253341620934,"y":0.84537938061556184,"w":0.77602691650390621,"c":1,"x":0.14800332351901468},{"t":"be more willing to accept Al into their lives.","x":0.148148152108076,"y":0.86627906960557355,"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592999,"w":0.41769546508789068},{"y":0.90261627887308438,"c":1,"w":0.02674897193908693,"t":"92","h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.10082304479177343},{"x":0.71953327191129191,"h":0.027004518273019973,"y":0.9556315279170291,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.25425661722819015}]}